  "content_id": "16136244",
  "title": "DigiByte (DGB) Network Fees",
  "description": "DigiByte (DGB) Network – Fast and Ultra-Affordable\nDigiByte is known for fast block times and very low fees — one of the quickest and chea...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JRTP0MB003J7Y2J96\">DigiByte (DGB) Network – Fast and Ultra-Affordable</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">DigiByte is known for <b>fast block times</b> and <b>very low fees</b> — one of the quickest and cheapest UTXO blockchains.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52J5W8AX8KXWERE1YBX\">How DigiByte Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees depend on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size in bytes</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge uses public DigiByte nodes to suggest the best fee based on current conditions.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>DigiByte blocks are mined every ~15 seconds</b>, meaning confirmations are fast even with a low fee.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JSME6ZPNRFM55BTJD\">Fee Options You Can Choose</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Very fast confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Smooth balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Slowest but cheapest</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Set your own fee manually</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">To adjust: Start a send → Tap <b>fee settings gear</b> → Pick or set a custom fee.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JSZT747ZYDM8G1EZH\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">A DGB transaction typically costs <b>less than $0.001 USD</b> — often fractions of a cent!</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JNCAWGB81GRYX3FEB\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">DigiByte is built for speed and affordability. Edge Wallet helps you pick the best fee with no technical headache—perfect for daily payments or quick moves.</p>",
